      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q9",
      "text": "I was worried about situations in which I might panic and make a fool of myself",
      "domain": "anxiety",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q10",
      "text": "I felt that I had nothing to look forward to",
      "domain": "depression",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q11",
      "text": "I found myself getting agitated",
      "domain": "stress",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q12",
      "text": "I found it difficult to relax",
      "domain": "stress",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q13",
      "text": "I felt down-hearted and blue",
      "domain": "depression",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q14",
      "text": "I was intolerant of anything that kept me from getting on with what I was doing",
      "domain": "stress",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q15",
      "text": "I felt I was close to panic",
      "domain": "anxiety",
      "response_format": {
        "type": "scale",
        "scale": "likert_0_3",
        "response_key": "dass21_q15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dass21_q16",
      "text": "I was unable to become enthusiastic about anything",
